        ("Round 2 · Pressure (four crises)", "Four crisis cards arrive one after another. Each reveal knocks 5% off every price. Product teams hire a consulting firm and write a response plan; the hired firm writes an advice memo; plans are judged and their scores move prices; companies rate their firm. Funds trade on every card and every score."),
