        "Each Round 2 crisis has one type: OPERATIONS, MARKET, TRUST or MONEY. Using one of each across the four crises tests a different skill every time.",
        "Every card carries numbers (a percentage lost, a cost in rupees, a time) so funds can price it and the judge can check plans against it.",
